meta {
  name: Send credential offer
  type: http
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{issuerMgmtUrl}}/v1/offers
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "participantDid": "{{identityDid}}",
    "credentialIds": ["membership-vc20"],
    "offerReason": "reissue"
  }
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 204
}

docs {
  The issuer sends a CredentialOfferMessage (DCP 6.6) to the credential service of a
  registered participant: here the identity of the "identity" folder. 204 once that
  service took it; see it with "identity/List credential offers". Without credentialIds
  every definition is offered. 404 when the participant is not registered, 502 when its
  credential service cannot be reached or refuses.
}
